OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies in four-vehicle crash in
OL,4,Asuburban street
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died after a crash involving
OL,7,Ffour vehicles in Ipswich.
OL,9,FSuffolk Police said a blue Ford Mustang
OL,10,Fcollided with a black Audi on Stone
OL,11,FLodge Lane, in Chantry, on Sunday at
OL,12,F16:05 GMT.
OL,14,FTwo parked cars with no-one inside - a
OL,15,Fsilver Vauxhall Corsa and a blue Volvo
OL,16,F- were also hit, near the road's
OL,17,Fjunction with Sleaford Close.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
