OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies in four-vehicle crash in
OL,4,Asuburban street
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe driver of the Mustang, a man in his
OL,7,F50s, died at the scene and officers
OL,8,Fwere investigating whether he died due
OL,9,Fto the crash or due to a medical
OL,10,Fincident beforehand. The force appealed
OL,11,Ffor witness and dashcam footage.
